<title>HONG KONG: IDT Intl renames LCD division.</title>
<headline>IDT Intl renames LCD division.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electronic manufacturer and distributor IDT International Ltd said on Monday its LCD Consumer Electronics Products Division would operate under a new name, IDT Technology Ltd, with effect from January 1, 1997.</p>
<p>The new company would be wholly-owned by the IDT Holdings (Singapore) Ltd which is expected to be listed on the Singapore Stock Exchange by the end of next month. it said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
